<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Fill all my vision, every desire</l><l>Keep for Thy glory; my soul inspire</l><l>With Thy perfection, Thy holy love,</l><l>Flooding my pathway with light from above.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Fill all my vision, let naught of sin</l><l>Shadow the brightness shining within.</l><l>Let me see only Thy blessed face,</l><l>Feasting my soul on Thy infinite grace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
